PROGRAM delivery quote

RECORD Parcel
  weight_grams: integer
  member: boolean

RECORD Quote
  status: "standard" | "manual"
  fee: integer

REQUEST quote delivery
  GIVEN parcel is Parcel
  GIVEN quote is Quote
    status: "standard"
    fee: 0
  WHEN quote delivery for parcel into quote
  OUTPUT quote is Quote
  THEN quote.fee >= 0

WHEN quote delivery for <parcel> into <quote>
  GIVEN parcel is Parcel
  AND quote is Quote
  REQUIRE parcel.weight_grams > 0
  DECIDE
    WHEN parcel.weight_grams > 5000
      set quote.status to "manual"
      set quote.fee to 0
    WHEN parcel.member
      set quote.status to "standard"
      set quote.fee to 0
    WHEN parcel.weight_grams <= 1500
      set quote.status to "standard"
      set quote.fee to 5
    ELSE
      set quote.status to "standard"
      set quote.fee to 9

BACKGROUND
GIVEN quote is Quote
  status: "standard"
  fee: 0

SCENARIO weight and membership determine the quote
GIVEN parcel is Parcel
  weight_grams: <weight>
  member: <member>

WHEN quote delivery for parcel into quote

THEN quote.status == <status>
AND quote.fee == <fee>

EXAMPLES
  | weight | member | status     | fee |
  | 1      | false  | "standard" | 5   |
  | 1000   | false  | "standard" | 5   |
  | 1001   | false  | "standard" | 5   |
  | 1499   | false  | "standard" | 5   |
  | 1500   | false  | "standard" | 5   |
  | 1501   | false  | "standard" | 9   |
  | 5000   | false  | "standard" | 9   |
  | 5001   | false  | "manual"   | 0   |
  | 1      | true   | "standard" | 0   |
  | 1000   | true   | "standard" | 0   |
  | 1001   | true   | "standard" | 0   |
  | 5000   | true   | "standard" | 0   |
  | 5001   | true   | "manual"   | 0   |

SCENARIO zero weight is rejected before changing the quote
GIVEN parcel is Parcel
  weight_grams: 0
  member: false

WHEN quote delivery for parcel into quote
THEN fails with "assertion_failed"
AND quote.status == "standard"
AND quote.fee == 0
